	(text "SST v2 — Suspension Telemetry Mainboard\nGreenfield revision (post-SBAS853A hardware review)\n\nKey signal-quality features:\n  • TPS7A4700 ultra-low-noise LDO (4 µVrms) supplies +3V0_ANA for ADC + Pot\n  • Decoupling per SBAS853A §10: 1 µF X7R on AVDD/DVDD, 220 nF on CAP — single GND plane (no AGND/DGND split)\n  • OPA2333 Sallen-Key (Gain = 1, f_c ≈ 250 Hz) + 2.5:1 voltage divider + TI differential 1 kΩ+10 nF+1 kΩ AAF at ADC input → overall Gain 0.4 (0…3 V pot → 0…1.2 V matches ADC FSR ±1.2 V)\n  • ADS131M02 has only internal 1.2 V Vref — no external REFIN; gain calibrated via CHn_GCAL register\n  • Common-mode chokes at every pot connector\n  • Buzzer differential drive (GP21+GP22, ±3.3V, +6 dB vs single-ended)\n\nPin-Map (verify against firmware/src/fw/hardware_config.h):\n  GP2/3   PIO-I2C    → DS3231 RTC + SSD1306 OLED + MAX17048 Fuel Gauge\n  GP4/5   Buttons L/R (L zusaetzlich Power-Taste via MAX16150)\n  GP7     ADS131 /RESET   GP10-13 spi1 SCK/SDI/SDO/CS   GP20 DRDY\n  GP8/9   i2c0  → IMU Fork (0x6A) + Rear (0x6B)\n  GP14/15 i2c1  → IMU Frame (0x6A) + Handlebar (0x6B, upgrade slot)\n  GP16-19 spi0  → MicroSD\n  GP21+22 Buzzer differential\n  GP28    PWR_OFF (high = Abschalten, Q_PWR3 -> MAX16150 CLR)\n\nNote: passive R/C placements and inter-component wires are left for the layout pass in KiCad.\nAll nets are tied via global labels; ERC will resolve correctly on first open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "MCU — Pico 2 W (U1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000010")
	)
	(text "ADC — ADS131M02 (U2) — 2-ch 24-bit Σ∆, simultaneous"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 440 83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000020")
	)
	(text "TCXO Y1 — 8.192 MHz HCMOS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 400 52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000030")
	)
	(text "U_AAF — OPA2333 dual op-amp (zero-drift)\nVoltage-follower Sallen-Key 2nd-order LPF per channel\nf_c ≈ 250 Hz, Q = 0.707 (R_SK1=R_SK2=22k, C_SK1=47n, C_SK2=22n)\nGain = 1 — Spannungs-Attenuierung 2.5:1 erfolgt nachgelagert"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.28 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000040")
	)
	(text "POT-Anschluss & Eingangskette (Gain 0.4 overall)\nPin1: +3V0_ANA via 47Ω + lokal 10µF/100nF/10nF\nPin2: Wiper → CMC → R_SK1(22k) → SK-Node → R_SK2(22k) → OPA-IN+\n      → OPA_Out → R_atten1(1.5k 0.1%) → Atten-Node → R_filt_P(1k) → AIN_xP\nPin3: VRef- → CMC → R_filt_N(1k) → AIN_xN (Kelvin)\nAtten-Node → R_atten2(1.0k 0.1%) → GND  (2.5:1 divider, Gain 0.4)\nC_diff = 10 nF C0G zwischen AIN_xP und AIN_xN (TI Fig. 9-1 differential RC)\nC_SK1 = 47nF (zu GND), C_SK2 = 22nF (zu OPA-OUT, bootstrap)\nESD: PESD3V3L4UF an Wiper + VRef-\nSignal: Pot 0…3V → OPA 0…3V → Atten 0…1.2V (matches ADC FSR ±1.2V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.96 224.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000050")
	)
	(text "U_ANA_LDO — TPS7A4700 ultra-low-noise LDO\n+3V3_DIG → +3V0_ANA (4 µVrms)\nVout = 1.4 V + 1.6 V: pin 8 (1P6V) an GND, andere ANY-OUT offen\nNR = 10 nF (C25), EN = +3V3_DIG, SENSE an OUT\nInput: C22 10 µF an +3V3_DIG; Output: C6 22 µF an +3V0_ANA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000060")
	)
	(text "POWER — LiPo → Q_RP1 → Q_PWR1 (Soft-Power MAX16150) → Schottky → VSYS\n+VBAT_SW → D_VSYS1 (PMEG3020EH) → VSYS (Pico)\nTPS7A4700: +3V3_DIG → +3V0_ANA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 221.46 56.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000070")
	)
	(text "STORAGE / RTC / DISPLAY\nMicroSD J_SD on spi0 (GP16-19), VDD=+3V3_DIG\nDS3231 U3 on PIO-I2C (GP2/3), shared with OLED\n  RTC_VBAT = CR1220 (BT1) direkt an U3 VBAT\n  4.7k pullups on DISP_SDA/SCL (mainboard, not OLED)\nOLED extern (J_OLED): SSD1306-Modul mit eigener Reg"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 240 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000080")
	)
	(text "IMU off-board connectors (4-pin JST-SH)\ni2c0 (GP8/9): Fork (0x6A, SA0=GND) + Rear (0x6B, SA0=VDD)\ni2c1 (GP14/15): Frame (0x6A, SA0=GND) + Handlebar (0x6B, upgrade)\nBus pullups: 4.7k SDA/SCL each bus to +3V3_DIG (mainboard)\nINT1/INT2 nicht verdrahtet — Firmware pollt."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 458.73 327.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000090")
	)
	(text "UI — Buttons + Buzzer + Debug\nBTN_L/R: TL3315NF160Q, 10k pullup zu +3V3_DIG, 100nF debounce\nBuzzer: differential drive (BUZ_DRV_A → 47Ω → BZ pin1;\n                          BUZ_DRV_B → 47Ω → BZ pin2)\n  BUZ_DRV_A/B sind GP22/GP21 PWM Slice A/B mit B_INV\nDebug: UART Header 1x3 (GP1 RX / GP0 TX / GND)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 267.97 389.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5c1a3e10-1000-0000-0000-000000000100")
	)
