		)
	)
	(text "Soft-Power + Fuel-Gauge (Rev. 3, 2026-10-03)\nSW_L1 (Taster links) -> PWR_BTN -> U_PWR1 PB_IN (interner Pull-up 1,4 MOhm an VCC).\nBTN_L (GP4, R27 10k an +3V3_DIG) ueber D_PWR1 RB751S40 an PWR_BTN: Taste bleibt UI-Taste.\nU_PWR1 OUT -> PSW_EN -> Q_PWR2 -> PSW_GATE low -> Q_PWR1 (P-MOS) leitet: +VBAT -> +VBAT_SW.\nAus: GP28 PWR_OFF high -> Q_PWR3 zieht CLR low -> OUT low. Taste > 8 s halten = Hardware-Aus.\nCLR-Pull-up R_PWR3 an OUT (Datenblatt-Empfehlung), kein VBAT-Pegel an GPIOs.\nU_FG1 MAX17048 (0x36) dauerhaft an +VBAT; Sleep bei SDA/SCL low > 2,5 s (MODE.EnSleep = 1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 416.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cc7ce2f9-009d-4f41-8bdf-18b53620db0c")
	)
